@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-development-token-here

### OpenAPI document (Development)
GET {{host}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### All registered sources
GET {{host}}/api/discovery?topic=dotnet&sortBy=date&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Repositories from GitHub within a publication date range
GET {{host}}/api/discovery?topic=dotnet&sources=github&type=repository&from=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-06T23:59:59Z&sortBy=title&sortDirection=asc&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid topic: 400 without provider calls
GET {{host}}/api/discovery?topic=c%23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid result limit
GET {{host}}/api/discovery?topic=dotnet&limit=60
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Per-provider request counts and latency buckets
GET {{host}}/api/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
